                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The forward drawer — tempers that push. Adamant and Jolly for the body, Modest and Timid for the mind. Qiu wrote the labels; I just keep the key. Decide which argument your partner should win."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Linh Hua — the forward drawer",
                    Label: "drawer_forward"
                },
