                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The curio shelf came with the cabinet. Stones out of the greenhouse trade — a leaf for the growers, a sun for the believers. Not produce, I grant you. But they sell to the same hearts, and the hearts keep asking."
                        }
                    ],
